### Default URL
GET http://localhost:5000/

### Default API URL
GET http://localhost:5000/api/

### All contacts API URL
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/

### Get a contact API URL
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/6af07fbdd4509d952f202b8a

### Add a new contact
POST http://localhost:5000/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cengiz",
  "age": 23
}

###

### Modifie a contact
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/6af07fbdd4509d952f202b8a
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cengiz"
}

###

### Delete a contact
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/6af0b7344f942d8b29828b86